## Available Commands

### Development
- `npm run compile` - Compile smart contracts
- `npm run node` - Start local Hardhat node
- `npm run deploy:local` - Deploy to localhost
- `npm run deploy:sepolia` - Deploy gas-optimized version to Sepolia testnet (NEW in v0.2.0)
- `npm run verify:sepolia` - Verify contracts on Etherscan (NEW in v0.2.0)

### Testing
- `npm test` - Run all test cases (36 total)
- `npm run test:verbose` - Run tests with detailed output
- `npm run test:coverage` - Generate test coverage report
- `npm run test:gas` - Run gas optimization comparison tests (NEW in v0.2.0)
- `npm run generate:report` - Generate comprehensive instructor report
- `npx hardhat test test/GasComparison.test.ts` - Run gas optimization tests (NEW in v0.2.0)
- `./run-tests.sh` - Run all tests + generate coverage (all-in-one)

### Coverage Reports
After running coverage, reports available at:
- `coverage/COVERAGE_REPORT.txt` - Text summary for submission
- `coverage/index.html` - Interactive HTML visualization
- `coverage/lcov.info` - For CI/CD integrationAlignment with Proposal (DAD_Project_Proposal.txt)

